  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "For our 5 by 6 matrix, the initial boundaries are top equals 0, bottom equals 4, left equals 0, and right equals 5.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 10780,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 323,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "These four boundaries describe the active rectangle.",
      "start_ms": 11580,
      "end_ms": 15260,
      "start_frame": 347,
      "end_frame": 458,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "And we maintain one important invariant.",
      "start_ms": 16140,
      "end_ms": 19120,
      "start_frame": 484,
      "end_frame": 574,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything outside the active rectangle has already been processed exactly once.",
      "start_ms": 19800,
      "end_ms": 25480,
      "start_frame": 594,
      "end_frame": 764,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything inside the active rectangle is still unprocessed.",
      "start_ms": 25480,
      "end_ms": 30740,
      "start_frame": 764,
      "end_frame": 922,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "So instead of moving cell by cell and asking whether each cell was visited, we peel complete edges.",
      "start_ms": 30800,
      "end_ms": 37920,
      "start_frame": 924,
      "end_frame": 1138,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Top edge, right edge, bottom edge, left edge.",
      "start_ms": 38240,
      "end_ms": 41740,
      "start_frame": 1147,
      "end_frame": 1252,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "After consuming an edge, we move that boundary inward.",
      "start_ms": 42300,
      "end_ms": 45860,
      "start_frame": 1269,
      "end_frame": 1376,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "But there is one important rule.",
      "start_ms": 46660,
